SUMMARY:Rooftop Salsa
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun evening of salsa dancing on the rooftop at Highland Brewing! \n💃 Salsa Lesson: 4:00–5:00 PM🕺 Open Dancing: 5:00–8:00 PM🎟️ $10 at the Door \nThe lesson is beginner-friendly\, and no partner is needed. After the class\, stay and dance the night away with fellow dancers while enjoying great music and beautiful rooftop views. \nAll levels are welcome. Come dance with us!
