SUMMARY:My Generation
DESCRIPTION:My Generation is a musical celebration of the songs that defined a generation. Bringing together three of Western North Carolina’s premier cover bands—Soul Blue\, Vintage Vinyl\, and Fringe Revival—this collaborative concert revisits the unforgettable sounds of the 1960s and 1970s\, from psychedelic rock\, folk\, and pop to soul\, R&B\, funk\, disco\, and classic rock. \nInspired by the powerful connection between music and memory\, My Generation taps into the nostalgia of the era that shaped the Baby Boomer generation. Each band has carefully curated a set list that honors the artists\, movements\, and moments that transformed popular music and culture. Whether you’re reliving treasured memories or discovering these timeless songs for the first time\, My Generation delivers an evening of exceptional musicianship\, infectious energy\, and the soundtrack of a remarkable era. \nAvoid the FOMO and go buy your tickets now!  Get Tickets \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/my-generation/
LOCATION:Event Center at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/My-Generation-680x410-1.png
END:VEVENT
