SUMMARY:The Sound Room AVL Summer Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Join The Sound Room for an unforgettable evening of live music at Highland Brewing! \nOur Summer Showcase features a curated lineup of standout student performers taking the stage for full-band sets backed by our instructors\, solo performances\, and big live moments across a wide range of music. These musicians have been working hard\, building confidence\, and bringing their songs to life and this is their night to shine. \nWhether you’re coming to support a performer or simply looking for a fun night of local live music\, expect great songs\, real energy\, and plenty of reasons to cheer. \nPlus\, The Sound Room is raffling off an Electric Guitar\, Free Lessons for a Month\, and a Merch Package for only $5 dollars per ticket!! \nFree and open to the public. Bring your friends\, grab a drink\, and come support the next generation of Asheville musicians! \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/the-sound-room-avl-summer-showcase/
LOCATION:Event Center at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Public Events
